WEBVTT

00:00.800 --> 00:06.100
This is Lanvi. An app for the months after depression treatment.

00:06.100 --> 00:10.700
You find a fox cub in the snow, and you keep him warm.

00:10.700 --> 00:15.600
Every day, he asks you for one small thing.

00:15.600 --> 00:24.300
Tonight, a ninety second game. You break the ice, and the northern lights come out.

00:24.300 --> 00:30.600
With your permission, the phone measures how you play, and how your face moves.

00:30.600 --> 00:34.000
Numbers only. No pictures leave the phone.

00:34.000 --> 00:36.100
You can talk to him.

00:36.100 --> 00:41.500
In the evening, he asks for three good things.

00:41.500 --> 00:45.800
And on a hard day, help is one tap away.

00:45.800 --> 00:51.500
Ask for it, and your clinic sees it the same day.

00:51.500 --> 00:58.700
Lanvi. The fox you rescue keeps the light on for you.
